--- a/Changes
+++ b/Changes
@@ -1,5 +1,17 @@
 Revision history for Perl extension Wx.
 
+    - Keep declared wxWidgets libraries as direct dependencies on Linux
+      so RUNPATH locates indirect dependencies such as XRC's HTML library.
+    - Return failure instead of dereferencing a null pointer when loading
+      a plugin fails (Niko Tyni, Debian #758127).
+
+    - Include required headers explicitly for newer ExtUtils::ParseXS
+      INCLUDE ordering (Perl 5.44 and later). Adapted from Niko Tyni's
+      fix in Debian #1141461 and CPAN RT #179905.
+    - Omit wxColour::GetPixel on GTK3, where wxWidgets does not provide
+      it, and convert colour property values through wxAny to avoid an
+      ambiguous wxVariant constructor (Olly Betts, Debian gtk3.patch).
+
 0.9932 Tue Apr 18 2017
     - fix build for Perl 5.25.11 ( . no longer in @INC )
     - RT:121224 - fixes broken 0.9930 commit for keycode constants
